WEBVTT

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:18.950
Governor Iwazu.
Thank you for your talk today.

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:24.910
Not at all. I'm always happy to address
the topic of regulating speech.

00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:29.290
Why don't we discuss it further
over dinner?

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:32.410
I've got a car waiting for me,
so no, thank you.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.660
Have a good evening.

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:42.830
Excuse me!

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:44.700
Please follow that car!

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:46.450
Okay.

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:50.830
Please!

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:04.410
Super HXEROS!

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:07.950
Episode 12: HXEROS Showdown!

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:10.000
Then...

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.500
"NO PETS"
Chacha is our only way to tell whether
a human is a camouflaged Kiseichuu?

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:15.870
Chacha is our only way to tell whether
a human is a camouflaged Kiseichuu?

00:01:15.870 --> 00:01:17.910
That's right.

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:22.540
But that being said, having her verify it
in broad daylight is dangerous

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:25.660
if it does turn out to be
a real Kiseichuu.

00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:29.620
Nobody would believe us
in the first place.

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:33.040
Then we might as well...

00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:35.660
go see her directly.

00:01:35.660 --> 00:01:37.120
True.

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:43.620
What's wrong, Chacha?

00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:45.700
Hey, Retto...

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:49.540
...am I useful to everyone?

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:54.700
Even though HXEROS is no more,
everyone is still taking care of me

00:01:54.700 --> 00:01:58.200
and letting me live with them.

00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:01.660
But I haven't been able
to do anything yet.

00:02:01.660 --> 00:02:03.200
That's not true.

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:07.160
You're always helping us like this.

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:11.330
But also we wouldn't
have had our suits without you.

00:02:13.370 --> 00:02:16.870
Well, I'm glad that I met all of you, too.

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:19.160
"FARE"

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:22.120
My New Year's money.

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:24.250
Just so you know,
we have to get home, too.

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:30.870
Anyway, why does the governor
live in a remote place like this?

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:33.290
It is a little strange.

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:37.040
What should we do now? If a bunch
of high school kids show up uninvited,

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:39.330
it's way too suspicious.

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:40.910
Maybe ding-dong ditch?

00:02:40.910 --> 00:02:43.330
And what if she's really the governor?

00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:45.040
Then I'll go.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:49.620
If I go alone in disguise, I can get close
without raising suspicions.

00:02:49.620 --> 00:02:51.290
I-It's too dangerous!

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:53.330
She could be the enemy!

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:56.500
We can't let you go alone, Chacha.

00:02:56.500 --> 00:03:00.700
Maybe so,
but I want to be more helpful to you guys!

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:04.750
When I was alone,
you all gave me a place to belong.

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:09.120
If there's a possibility
of going back there...

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:12.620
I feel like I can do my best here.

00:03:12.620 --> 00:03:14.200
Chacha.

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:20.750
Besides, if push comes to shove,
I have faith that you'll all save me.

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:21.910
We will.

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:25.580
It's a promise.

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:28.370
Listen, Chacha,
what you have to do is simple.

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:33.790
Just go to the governor's house,
and look for signs that she's a Kiseichuu.

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:36.540
If there's no problem,
then come on back.

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:38.580
And if she's a Kiseichuu?

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:42.750
We'll come to the rescue,
so you escape as fast as you can.

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:45.910
It'll be okay. I can do this.

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:54.580
I-I'm here to deliver a package.

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:56.410
Will she be okay?

00:03:56.410 --> 00:03:59.330
I'm a little worried
about that stilted speech.

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:01.000
--Coming.
--Here she is!

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:02.120
Yes?

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:05.500
This is the governor?

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:08.750
The governor is the one
who looks like a molester!

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:11.040
I-I need you to sign this.

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:12.080
Oh.

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:21.080
What happened to Chacha?

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:22.200
What's she doing?

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:25.950
Shirayuki!

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:28.500
Everyone, please stay there!

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:30.040
Sheesh!

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:33.200
She's the one who said
this was too dangerous!

00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:40.700
Huh? Where did they go?

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:43.910
Are you sure about this?
Just going in...

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:45.830
The door was wide open.

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:48.660
And we're looking for someone,
so we won't get in trouble.

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:57.000
Chacha!

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:03.950
I'm so happy you came back...

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:08.290
...my beloved daughter!

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:14.040
And I'm delighted that you brought me
such lovely souvenirs!

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:17.370
Now, why don't we have dinner over here?

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:19.620
What the hell is going on?

00:05:19.620 --> 00:05:24.080
H-Hey, did she just call Chacha
her daughter?

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:26.000
Then...

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:28.410
...she's the Kiseichuu queen?

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:31.700
I didn't think
we would be reunited so soon.

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:41.290
And as for you, how dare you
free this girl when I had her locked up?

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:42.790
Get away from her, Chacha!

00:05:42.790 --> 00:05:44.910
I'll take her down!

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:55.870
It's okay.

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:58.700
I won't hurt your friends,
so don't worry.

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:01.870
I'm just going to make it
so that they can't escape.

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:03.790
Oh, that's right.

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:06.120
This room is made
out of H-energy-proof materials,

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:10.580
so you can try to get out,
but it'll be a waste of time.

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:13.910
You would be accumulating H-energy
for nothing.

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:23.000
It's locked.

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:24.500
Here, too.

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:28.540
Don't tell me Chacha betrayed us.

00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:31.250
O-Of course she hasn't!

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:35.750
Sorry, Maihime.
I don't seriously think that!

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:39.330
I'm sorry for overreacting. It's just...

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:44.700
I'm worried about Chacha.
It's like she's in a trance.

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:49.580
We have to find some way
to get out of here.

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:50.870
What do you think?

00:06:50.870 --> 00:06:54.200
This planet's food isn't bad, is it?

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:58.040
At any rate,
those humans must be surprised.

00:06:58.040 --> 00:07:05.950
Surely they didn't expect that I could use
my ability to control all Kiseichuu.

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:09.160
What's wrong? Aren't you going to eat?

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:13.080
I-I don't want it.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:17.910
I see. You're right.

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:21.540
This isn't the kind of meal
that's meant for us.

00:07:23.450 --> 00:07:26.910
But you don't have to worry.

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:34.950
I'll prepare a proper
H-energy feeding ground for us.

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:38.000
By using those humans.

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:42.830
I realized that we have had
to keep moving from planet to planet

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:46.040
because we keep eradicating
those planet's races.

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:50.660
But now we'll isolate many humans who have
extremely high amounts of H-energy

00:07:50.660 --> 00:07:55.750
and make them cattle
to provide us with that H-energy forever.

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:01.660
I-I won't let you.

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:03.830
I won't let you do it!

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:13.200
No good. H-energy really
can't pass through this room.

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:16.250
Damn it. And of all things,
we're out of range here.

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:18.790
Then there's nothing we can do?

00:08:18.790 --> 00:08:21.250
No, there's still a way.

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:27.790
Except it's a method
that's forbidden at Saitama Branch.

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:30.910
It'll take a lot of determination
to break that rule.

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:33.160
Y-You don't mean...

00:08:33.160 --> 00:08:35.410
No, that's the one thing I can't do!

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:37.000
What are you talking about, Enjo?

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:40.000
This is an emergency,
so if it's the only way,

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:43.500
we have to do it, whatever it is!

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:47.000
So what is it?

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:49.250
It's...

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:53.000
...all of the members doing it together.

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:55.290
Wh-What are you saying?!

00:08:55.290 --> 00:09:00.120
The only way to break through this wall
is by unleashing unforeseen power.

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:02.950
T-Tell her, Shirayuki!

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:04.120
Let's do it!

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:10.040
I can't believe
that Chacha would betray us.

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:13.080
There has to be more to it!

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:17.160
Finding that out is another reason
we have to break out of here now!

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:19.910
An escape room
with the solution being an orgy.

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:21.790
I see. I can use that in a story.

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:23.290
You, too, Sora?

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:26.500
You said you'd be up for anything!

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:28.830
I-I know, but...

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:30.700
What should I do?

00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:35.040
At this rate,
we'll all fall into Enjo's clutches.

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:40.950
Well, even I agree that's an aggravating
way for Ret to collect H-energy.

00:09:40.950 --> 00:09:42.040
So...

00:09:44.540 --> 00:09:45.910
Everyone, listen!

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:51.120
You really should do this kind of thing
with the person you already have in mind.

00:09:51.120 --> 00:09:52.540
I think the se--

00:09:52.540 --> 00:09:56.200
the H-energy
will be stronger that way, too.

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:58.410
Therefore...

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:02.160
I say we turn off the lights
so we don't know who's who,

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:06.120
and we'll accumulate H-energy
with the power of our fantasies.

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:08.660
That's my condition.

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:10.120
Q-Question.

00:10:10.120 --> 00:10:14.040
So I'm supposed to do everyone?

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:18.200
Kirara finally agreed to do this,
so don't pour cold water on it!

00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:22.620
I'm Mogana Iwazu, 17 years old.

00:10:22.620 --> 00:10:24.000
Yeah, right!

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:31.120
Huh?

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:33.040
Has it...

00:10:33.040 --> 00:10:34.910
...already begun?

00:10:37.410 --> 00:10:39.620
The size of these breasts...

00:10:39.620 --> 00:10:42.200
That is, the small size.

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:44.580
Momozono?

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:48.620
Feels like I drew the winning number.

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:51.250
Hey, what's Momozono doing?

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:54.700
I can't take much more of this!

00:10:54.700 --> 00:10:58.660
Huh? Where did Retto go?

00:10:58.660 --> 00:11:00.580
Gotcha!

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:07.120
Huh? Why is it so smooth?

00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:09.330
Wait, this isn't Retto!

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:14.700
We can't do this, Chiya!

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:17.750
Who?

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:19.330
Saved.

00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:22.330
Now I have to search for my pants.

00:11:22.330 --> 00:11:25.870
Will I be able to see a little
if I squint?

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:28.200
I can't see anything.

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:29.700
What is that?

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:33.000
I feel warm breath on my behind.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:36.330
If I can't see anything,
how about using my nose?

00:11:39.950 --> 00:11:42.160
No, this isn't working, either.

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:48.830
I'll just have to grope
my way around for them.

00:11:51.700 --> 00:11:53.040
Hey.

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:56.500
Would you not gasp
as you tickle your armpits?

00:11:56.500 --> 00:12:01.700
You're not collecting any H-energy,
so I'm giving you a good example.

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:03.500
I didn't ask for your help!

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:05.790
There you go again.

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:09.250
After I set the stage for you,
you mean to cower in the corner?

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:13.950
Ret might be having his way
with the other girls right now.

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:17.750
The truth is, I want to...

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:23.580
It's okay. It's pitch-black in here,
so no one will know if I just...

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:29.160
This feels like... Is it...

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:30.620
Enjo?

00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:32.040
Hoshino?

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:38.120
Hey, what's happening here?

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:41.080
I think we've fallen between two beds.

00:12:41.080 --> 00:12:43.250
Fine, now get off me!

00:12:43.250 --> 00:12:47.000
I'd like to, but my hand
is stuck under you.

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:49.450
Could you lift up your hips
for a second?

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:57.410
I can't. I'm sensitive down there
right now, and it's Dark Kirara's fault!

00:12:57.410 --> 00:12:58.370
Hoshino?

00:12:58.370 --> 00:13:01.750
Sorry. My legs feel like jelly.

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:05.950
I'm going to lift up now, b-but slowly...

00:13:05.950 --> 00:13:10.450
My eyes are gradually adjusting
to the dark, but Hoshino...

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:13.660
Okay. Pull it out.

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:16.160
What kind of expression is that?

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:19.160
If you show me that face, it makes me...

00:13:23.660 --> 00:13:27.370
You wouldn't dare defy the Queen,
would you?

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:31.160
I suppose I should lock you up again.

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:34.200
Y-You can't control me anymore!

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:37.750
Now that you mention it,
you've suddenly mutated.

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:40.290
But if you give up now,
I'll still forgive you.

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:43.200
Whose side are you on?

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:48.500
True, I'm neither Kiseichuu nor human.

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:51.160
But the one thing I can say for sure...

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:53.370
I'm a member of HXEROS!

00:13:55.450 --> 00:13:57.950
Oh? That's unfortunate.

00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:03.330
Hxe Red!

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:04.830
Hxe Yellow!

00:14:04.830 --> 00:14:06.370
Hxe Pink!

00:14:06.370 --> 00:14:08.120
Hxe White!

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:09.540
Hxe Blue!

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:12.830
We are HXEROS!

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:19.500
Everyone!

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:25.000
I'm sorry!
I don't know why this happened.

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:27.870
Thank goodness!
You're back to normal!

00:14:27.870 --> 00:14:30.700
It's okay now. We're with you.

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:36.160
After I went to the trouble of choosing
a kind way to deal with you...

00:14:36.160 --> 00:14:38.950
But I suppose this calls for punishment.

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:41.160
You took the words right out of my mouth!

00:14:42.200 --> 00:14:45.000
Solar Phaser!

00:14:48.410 --> 00:14:52.000
Bewitching Blow! Unbalancing Pine Needle!

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:56.700
Surrender, Mother.

00:14:56.700 --> 00:15:03.870
I see. Well, you were strong enough to
break out of the H-energy-resistant room.

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:07.500
Before, I let you run free because of
your superior H-energy production.

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:10.080
But I can't afford that any longer.

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:11.540
Therefore...

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:16.250
What's that noise?

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:22.540
A biological weapon
that our ancestor created.

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:27.540
When I give it too much energy,
it becomes humongous.

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:30.330
Now get them!

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:35.040
Seriously?

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:38.200
What is this?

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:39.410
Are you all okay?

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:41.330
What the hell is this thing?

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:45.540
It seems to have become addicted
to H-energy.

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:48.500
Wouldn't it be a catastrophe
if it was let loose in the city?

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:50.700
Do what you can.

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:52.580
You two, go after her!

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:53.290
But...

00:15:53.290 --> 00:15:55.620
We'll handle this somehow
with our own strength!

00:15:55.620 --> 00:16:00.120
It's okay. We still have H-energy
left over from that room.

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:01.250
All right!

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:03.830
I swear we'll come back!

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:08.410
Pulse Echo Cannon!

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:13.000
We're still your opponents, not them!

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:15.250
Huh? It had no effect?

00:16:15.250 --> 00:16:16.370
Why?

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:18.500
The XERO gear doesn't work
on this monster?

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:21.620
Is it siphoning the H-energy?

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:25.120
It feels like those sea cucumbers!

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:28.750
And like that queen said...

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:31.830
...the more energy it absorbs,
the bigger it gets!

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:36.870
I'm helpless against this.

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:39.290
But together, we can...

00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:45.790
Everyone! We can't lose
against a lust monster like this!

00:16:50.200 --> 00:16:52.500
What is this? My body is hot!

00:16:52.500 --> 00:16:56.160
It feels like unlimited H-energy
is coursing through my body!

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:57.660
And...

00:16:57.660 --> 00:17:00.620
It feels wonderful!

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:03.370
HXEROS Beast Mode!

00:17:13.910 --> 00:17:16.370
What just happened?

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:21.500
I can't believe it. Even our XERO suits
couldn't withstand that H-energy.

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:26.000
We're counting on you, Enjo and Hoshino.

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:29.370
Hoshino, um, sorry about earlier!

00:17:29.370 --> 00:17:31.040
I mean, for what happened.

00:17:31.040 --> 00:17:32.290
Y-You better be!

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:35.040
I suspect you made us
fall off the bed on purpose!

00:17:35.040 --> 00:17:36.790
Look, I apologized!

00:17:36.790 --> 00:17:39.120
And we both felt it!

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:43.080
There's a way you should say things
and a way you shouldn't!

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:44.450
S-Sorry.

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:45.790
Hmph!

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:50.580
I'm surprised. I didn't think
you would come for me alone.

00:17:54.580 --> 00:17:56.870
What did you do to me?

00:17:56.870 --> 00:17:58.870
My ability is...

00:17:58.870 --> 00:18:02.620
...mind-controlling all Kiseichuu.

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:06.910
However, that also includes creatures
I've given my blood to.

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:09.700
What does that mean?

00:18:09.700 --> 00:18:13.450
Huh? I can't move!

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:15.370
Are you okay, Hoshino?

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:19.660
H-Hoshino?

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:22.200
Hey, what are you doing, Dark Kirara?!

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:25.080
I mean, what am I being made to do?

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:26.540
This is perfect.

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:30.330
You've destroyed so many of my sisters,

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:33.830
so I'd better take this fresh, powerful
H-energy that is coursing through you

00:18:33.830 --> 00:18:36.080
and use it to lay new eggs.

00:18:38.040 --> 00:18:39.870
C-Can't breathe.

00:18:39.870 --> 00:18:42.290
It seems you can't resist.

00:18:42.290 --> 00:18:46.080
In the end, this is human nature.

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:52.450
What do you think?
You could still become my cattle.

00:18:52.450 --> 00:18:56.700
Isn't there anything?
A way to make her go back to normal?

00:18:56.700 --> 00:18:58.620
At this rate, we really will...

00:18:58.620 --> 00:19:00.200
No, think!

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:02.750
All this time we've been together!

00:19:02.750 --> 00:19:05.450
Hoshino's weakness is...

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:08.580
Not working. It's not working at all.

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:11.540
I can't feel any H-energy at all this way.

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:13.750
Hoshino, your good point...

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:16.870
...is not realizing how attractive you are.

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:19.370
Enjo, what are you saying?

00:19:19.370 --> 00:19:21.540
On the one hand,
you're self-assured and obstinate,

00:19:21.540 --> 00:19:23.500
and on the other, you're easily pressured.

00:19:23.500 --> 00:19:27.790
You're serious and yet, even though you
complained about it, you joined HXEROS.

00:19:27.790 --> 00:19:31.700
Even when you're blushing,
you're still cute.

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:34.620
But because that's who you are,

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:37.620
the best part is occasionally
getting to see you smile!

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:42.870
That's why, even more than before,
Hoshino, I'm in love with--

00:19:42.870 --> 00:19:45.950
What are you talking about
at a time like this, idiot?

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:50.330
You're back.

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:53.200
I was right. This is the way
you're supposed to be.

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:58.410
That was a rough method.

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:03.790
Let's go, Hoshino.

00:20:03.790 --> 00:20:06.660
Let's beat her together!

00:20:06.660 --> 00:20:12.660
How dare cattle like you
interfere with my meal?

00:20:12.660 --> 00:20:15.500
I'm going to finish you right here!

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:22.370
This feeling, I remember it.

00:20:22.370 --> 00:20:24.410
The first day we fought...

00:20:42.750 --> 00:20:47.080
I've never felt H-energy like this.

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:48.500
I'm in love!

00:20:48.500 --> 00:20:54.830
Their fused H-energy is more delicious
than anything I've had before!

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:59.040
This is the H-energy source
that we were searching for.

00:21:03.450 --> 00:21:07.790
It's over, isn't it? Our war?

00:21:07.790 --> 00:21:10.450
Yeah. I'm sure it is.

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:13.950
So that promise you made me
still stands, doesn't it?

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:17.250
You promised that if we defeated
all of the Kiseichuu...

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:19.700
you would answer my proposal.

00:21:19.700 --> 00:21:23.410
I'll give you my answer then.

00:21:23.410 --> 00:21:25.410
Wh-What are you saying
at a time like this?

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:27.250
A time like what?

00:21:27.250 --> 00:21:31.330
I was able to make it this far,
because that was my emotional support!

00:21:32.870 --> 00:21:35.540
There are still Kiseichuu
in other places, aren't there?

00:21:35.540 --> 00:21:37.540
We have to beat them first!

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:43.790
Well, I guess that's good enough for now.

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:45.830
What are you grinning about?

00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:49.370
I was just thinking
that maybe it wouldn't have been bad

00:21:49.370 --> 00:21:51.330
if I'd seen you blush a little longer.

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:56.830
I'm gonna quit being a hero!

00:23:27.580 --> 00:23:28.790
"DAYS LATER"

00:23:28.790 --> 00:23:32.160
"DAYS LATER"
Well, for a while there,
I didn't know what was going to happen,

00:23:32.160 --> 00:23:36.040
but the charges against me were dropped,
and HXEROS is together again.

00:23:36.040 --> 00:23:37.500
I look forward
to our continued work together.

00:23:37.500 --> 00:23:40.870
Oh, and I'll have to improve
those XERO suits.

00:23:40.870 --> 00:23:42.910
--Right.
--I'll help!

00:23:42.910 --> 00:23:44.290
Thank you.

00:23:48.200 --> 00:23:49.750
What's the matter?

00:23:49.750 --> 00:23:52.120
Is your H-energy spent?

00:23:52.120 --> 00:23:54.540
--I knew it!
--H-Hey!

00:23:54.540 --> 00:23:56.410
Momoka, stop it!

00:23:56.410 --> 00:23:57.660
There they go again.

00:23:57.660 --> 00:23:59.580
Cut it out!
